event_description:
&lt;p&gt;Ball &amp; Chain presents &lt;br /&gt;
Matine Cubana&lt;br /&gt;
with DJ Danis LaClave &amp; Friends&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Ball &amp; Chain invites you to join us for&lt;br /&gt;
Live Jazz featuring Tal Cohen and The Ball &amp; Chain Trio&lt;br /&gt;
Monday 6 - 9pm&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Mambo Mondays&lt;br /&gt;
presented by Carlos Saoco&lt;br /&gt;
Set by DJ Iván&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Ball &amp; Chain invites you to join us for&lt;br /&gt;
Live Jazz featuring Calixto Oviedo &amp; The Ball &amp; Chain Trio&lt;br /&gt;
Every Tuesday from 6 - 9pm&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;BachaTuesdays at Ball &amp; Chain&lt;br /&gt;
Set by DJ Vila&lt;br /&gt;
Free Bachata Class at 9:00PM&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Ball &amp; Chain presents &lt;br /&gt;
Matine Cubana&lt;br /&gt;
with DJ Danis LaClave &amp; Friends&lt;/p&gt;

